logy-NPU03804\">NPU03804</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Pt—Body; mass = ? kg</td><td>Patient—Body; mass = ? kilogram</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://tx-nordics.fhir.org/fhir/r4/ValueSet/npu-terminology#npu-terminology-NPU19748\">NPU19748</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">P—C-reactive protein; mass c. = ? mg/L</td><td>Plasma—C-reactive protein; mass concentration = ? milligram per litre</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://tx-nordics.fhir.org/fhir/r4/ValueSet/npu-terminology#npu-terminology-NPU22089\">NPU22089</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">P(cB)—Glucose; subst.c. = ? mmol/L</td><td>Plasma(capillary Blood)—Glucose; substance concentration = ? millimole per litre</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://tx-nordics.fhir.org/fhir/r4/ValueSet/npu-terminology#npu-terminology-NPU03963\">NPU03963</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">U—Erythrocytes; arb.c.(proc.) = ?</td><td>Urine—Erythrocytes; arbitrary concentration(procedure) = ?</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://tx-nordics.fhir.org/fhir/r4/ValueSet/npu-terminology#npu-terminology-NPU21692\">NPU21692</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Heart—Systole; freq. = ? × 1/min</td><td>Heart—Systole; frequency = ? one per minute</td></tr></table></li><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"CodeSystem-MedCom-xds-analysis-codes-CS.html\"><code>http://medcomfhir.dk/ig/xdsmetadata/CodeSystem/MedCom-xds-analysis-codes-CS</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated, which means it is fixed to the version provided in this specification\"> version ?1.0.0</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-MedCom-xds-analysis-codes-CS.html#MedCom-xds-analysis-codes-CS-MCS88100\">MCS88100</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Lunge—Lungefunktionsundersøgelse COPD FEV6; vol. = ? L</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-MedCom-xds-analysis-codes-CS.html#MedCom-xds-analysis-codes-CS-MCS88015\">MCS88015</a></td><td style=\"color: